Oil of unlife is an alchemical liquid, thick and black, that leaves a dark trail down the side of a glass flask. It is unpleasanter to drink than it looks, and it mends the flesh of things sustained by death rather than life, the way a healing draught mends the living.

Two robed men in the sewers beneath [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], both now dead, each carried a small corked vial of the lesser sort.
